# roux build's working files, and the app it builds (named after main.roc).
.roux/
main
# Made by roux build: every template of the app, as one tag union, and the
# layouts they were compiled for. The build writes it first.
templates/Templates.roc
# Made by roux build: the holes' Roc, which changes with every hole edit. A
# template's own module changes only when what it takes does.
templates/Holes.roc
# The app's SQLite database.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
